config BR2_PACKAGE_GAMEOS_SLEEPD
	bool "gameos-sleepd (lid-close suspend)"
	help
	  Lid-close suspend-to-RAM daemon: pauses the emulator, runs the
	  sleep.d hooks (Wi-Fi driver out and back), suspends with a
	  deep/s2idle fallback ladder, and stays dark-and-awake while
	  charging so the charging LED survives.

	  Part of gameOS for the Anbernic RG DS Plus.